---
layout: page/layout
---

<section id="EV" style="--box-bg-color: <%= page.blockBgColor %>;" class="fade-in-once">
  <section id="banner" class="box">
    <div class="left">
      <h1>未竟之聲</h1>
      <h2>Endless Voice</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="right flex flex-col items-center">
      <div class="hover-box flex flex-col items-center gap-8 text-center w-fit px-4 xl:px-0">
        <%- partial('_partial/svg/branch_top') %>
        <div class="grid">
          <div class="context default flex items-center justify-center">
            <h6 class="">
              「只有在彈琴的那刻，才覺得自己與世界連結在一起。」<br><br>
              那年她絕望地逃離故土，留下少女未曾出口的欽慕。<br>
              幾年過去，兩人之間的鴻溝從時間長河，束收成一牆兩門的距離。<br>
              她從「老師」，變成「鄰居」，變成「朋友」，變成……<br><br>

              從窗外飄來的琴聲，恍若續寫未完成的緣分。
            </h6>
          </div>
          <div class="context hover flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
            <h6 class="text-center">
              故事背景位於現代台灣的架空北部都市，以日常校園為主。<br>部分情節與現實稍有不符。<br><br>
              時間軸為「雨後朝陽」的七年後。<br>並非外傳性質，可獨立閱讀不影響理解。
            </h6>
          </div>
        </div>
        <%- partial('_partial/svg/branch_bottom') %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="characters-area" class=" mt-10">
    <div class="p-8 box w-fit">
      <div class="flex flex-row items-center mb-6">
        <h2>
          MAIN CHARACTERS
        </h2>
        <!-- <a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Cxz4chKcb1_rkF7xz_W2xEI7c2XZCl3L5kT-26hfEJY/edit?gid=905747692#gid=905747692" class="btn ms-auto">詳細設定</a> -->
      </div>

      <div class="name-list columns-2 h-full text-left gap-8">

        <div class="character-card">
          <div class="avatar">
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>時予曦</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="character-card">
          <div class="avatar">
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>於又綾</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="character-card">
          <div class="avatar">
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>時艾寧</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="character-card">
          <div class="avatar">
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>遲詠青</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="character-card">
          <div class="avatar">
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>黎書琴</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="character-card">
          <div class="avatar">
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>簡雅心</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="character-card">
          <div class="avatar">
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>黎旻潔</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="character-card">
          <div class="avatar">
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>黎家澤</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="character-card">
          <div class="avatar">
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>陳翠蘭</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="character-card">
          <div class="avatar">
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>謝悅萍</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="character-card">
          <div class="avatar">
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>羅惟芬</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="p-8 box w-full">
      <div class="flex flex-row items-center mb-6 ">
        <h2>
          TERMINOLOGY
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="noun-list">
        <table>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-dashed border border-gray-500 my-1">
              <td class="text-right mr-1 p-2  border-dashed border-r border-gray-500">仁北市</td>
              <td class="p-2">位於台灣北部的架空都市，大致位置介於新北與桃園的交界處。</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-dashed border border-gray-500 my-1">
              <td class="text-right mr-1 p-2 border-dashed border-r border-gray-500">景湖區</td>
              <td class="p-2">仁北市第一大區，永明高中所在地與冬城科大所在地。</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-dashed border border-gray-500 my-1">
              <td class="text-right mr-1 p-2 border-dashed border-r border-gray-500">靖山區</td>
              <td class="p-2">仁北市第二大區，恆安高中所在地。相對景湖區靠近山邊，房價較低且生活步調較慢。</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-dashed border border-gray-500 my-1">
              <td class="text-right mr-1 p-2 border-dashed border-r border-gray-500">冬陽溪</td>
              <td class="p-2"></td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-dashed border border-gray-500 my-1">
              <td class="text-right mr-1 p-2 border-dashed border-r border-gray-500">永明高中</td>
              <td class="p-2">位於景湖區的國立高中。建立迄今已近百年的升學向學校。校訓為「願智慧之光永恆長存」。(故事中僅會稍微提到，不會多加設定，詳情請參考<a href="https://afterthelight.wixsite.com/ymsh" class="underline">企劃網站</a>。)</td>

            </tr>
            <tr class="border-dashed border border-gray-500 my-1">
              <td class="text-right mr-1 p-2 border-dashed border-r border-gray-500">冬城科技大學</td>
              <td class="p-2"></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="creates-area" class=" mt-10">
    <div class="p-8 box">
      <h2 class="mb-4">
        ILLUSTRATION
      </h2>
      <div class="flex flex-row justify-center">
        <div id="gallery">
          <div class="gallery-sizer"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="p-8 box">
      <h2 class="mb-4">
        STORY
      </h2>
      <%- partial('_partial/post-category-pager', {
    id: 'story',
    category: '文章',
    perPage: 5,
    listClass: 'px-6',
    prevText: '上一頁',
    nextText: '下一頁'
  }) %>
    </div>
  </section>
</section>

